  "_comment": "Hand-curated affiliations the Hipolabs university list does not carry: national laboratories, government research agencies, and independent research institutes. Mycelium's readers are not all at universities. Keep one entry per organisation, name it the way its own staff write it, and give the domain people actually have email at. 'kind' is 'institute' for everything here; the picker groups it separately from universities.",
